  "notes": "{持|も}ち{上|あ}げる is a compound verb meaning to lift up physically or to flatter.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle for the object\n\nETYMOLOGY:\n⟦{持|も}つ→持つ：00478_motsu⟧ (to hold) + ⟦{上|あ}げる→あげる：00546_ageru⟧ (to raise) = to lift up\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{荷物|にもつ}→荷物：00737_nimotsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{持|も}ち{上|あ}げる: to lift luggage\n- ⟦{箱|はこ}→箱：02162_hako⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{持|も}ち{上|あ}げる: to lift a box\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{持|も}ち{上|あ}げる: to flatter someone\n- ⟦おだてて→おだてる：17564_odateru⟧{持|も}ち{上|あ}げる: to butter someone up\n\nUSAGE:\nThe \"flattery\" meaning comes from the image of elevating someone with praise. Often used critically to describe insincere praise or sycophantic behavior.",
